{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>加拿大流行巨星The Weeknd (本名：Abel Tesfaye）在過去周末，在舉行了兩場《After Hours Til Dawn Tour》香港站演唱會，現場座無虛席，萬人朝聖。The Weeknd在演唱會無預警播出新歌《Hong Kong》的MV，由於新歌破天荒神級無縫取樣（Sampling）樂壇天后王菲的粵語經典《季候風》，引起全球樂迷洗版各大社交平台。</p><figure><img alt=\"The Weeknd香港騷唱新作《Hong Kong》。（香港01　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190784417920978944572489.jpeg/ryTSFIyyN31B0eFJ_gLzSndKb92uThFje0zlpHtM5aQ\"/><figcaption>The Weeknd香港騷唱新作《Hong Kong》。（香港01　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MV特別於香港取景拍攝。（香港01　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190784426372894720408527.jpeg/ICLVCMt_XchiD0YiCaJ4Vh2w5cUnts5huD1hCLg9YQg\"/><figcaption>MV特別於香港取景拍攝。（香港01　攝）</figcaption></figure><p>《Hong Kong》的MV在特別在香港取景，並呈現樂充滿懷舊電影感的香港街景，拍攝氛圍接近The Weeknd喜愛的王家衛風格。MV曝光後，除了令大批香港樂迷大為感動之餘，更令人好奇究竟MV中的擁有精緻面孔的女主角是誰。</p><figure><img alt=\"The Weeknd迷幻R&amp;B融合王菲空靈旋律。（香港01　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261024/1190784420639019008672913.jpeg/jVe-c6YqtJDvjqwSpvNUPFvKkTO1CeDyJuDjIibg4yI\"/><figcaption>The Weeknd迷幻R&amp;B融合王菲空靈旋律。（香港01　攝）</figcaption></figure><p>王柳雯來自成都　IG坐擁50萬粉絲</p><p>現年30歲的王柳雯（Wiwen Wang）來自成都，活躍於時尚及藝術圈，同時是設計師、模特兒、時尚網紅及藝術空間WESPACE Gallery聯合創辦人。她憑精緻的五官及獨有的時尚高級感，在IG坐擁51萬粉絲。翻查其社交平台，王柳雯經常分享火辣性感照，亦經常周遊列國及出席時尚藝術品牌活動。另外，王柳雯昨日亦有在IG分享今次拍攝《Hong Kong》MV的幕後花絮，並留言表示：「Last week in Hong Kong wasn’t just a memory-it was a scene. Honored to be part of @theweeknd 's vision for this city.(上週在香港的經歷，不只是一段回憶，更是一幕精彩的景象。很榮幸能參與 @theweeknd 為這座城市構想的藍圖之中。)」</p><figure><img alt=\"現年30歲的王柳雯（Wiwen Wang）來自成都。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754116179955712634172.jpeg/e52C3pwjtL1KHcwjsnrl4RcTyU1J9kp3BmrMEwZqzBM\"/><figcaption>現年30歲的王柳雯（Wiwen Wang）來自成都。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王柳雯事後在IG分享拍攝MV的幕後花絮。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754113411584000087931.jpeg/1P_02Pe4S5h9fUlOQPuXT74NWHhtc3kD2O-38djvt_E\"/><figcaption>王柳雯事後在IG分享拍攝MV的幕後花絮。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王柳雯五官精緻。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754110181838848639547.jpeg/MHNTOEyqrnYPG07msuI4UG3Y-m7tMFV8k9VylpPVcpY\"/><figcaption>王柳雯五官精緻。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王柳雯活躍於時尚及藝術圈，同時是設計師、模特兒、時尚網紅及藝術空間WESPACE Gallery聯合創辦人。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754117090119680297046.jpeg/wy3IiUvGoHLItNUunwr-gX_yeFSmAyO5uwN9AbsDfQE\"/><figcaption>王柳雯活躍於時尚及藝術圈，同時是設計師、模特兒、時尚網紅及藝術空間WESPACE Gallery聯合創辦人。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王柳雯IG坐擁51萬粉絲。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754113898123264039671.jpeg/Q5tgZ5PJhU7Spk0lYSDQDuQYpPN3Z6fKrdAmwa3QJsE\"/><figcaption>王柳雯IG坐擁51萬粉絲。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"王柳雯經常在IG分享性感照。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191754111645650944031742.jpeg/Oqe2M5v61jHHrZX1CIhW0pVF6JFWF3v-ZCYqN2QmKjc\"/><figcaption>王柳雯經常在IG分享性感照。（IG/@__wiwenwen__）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T08:21:47.787364+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1023,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:41.106098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:41.974670+00:00","content_hash":"7d926e94f6a236608a6e3b7065a5b7abd561598bfcbfa9c9e4fa3a9442b63119","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}